  "description": "I \"transmigrated\" into a world I'd never seen before. For thirty years, I believed I was living in a classic fantasy RPG. I became a war hero, retired, and thought I was finally about to see the ending. But... Those thirty years were only the prologue. It turns out the real story is about an academy?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
